sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as User
  participant Browser as Browser UI
  participant Tracker as HeatmapTracker
  participant API as POST /api/analytics/heatmap
  participant Store as Supabase: analytics
  participant Admin as Admin UI

  Note over User,Browser: User berinteraksi dan melakukan klik pada halaman
  User->>Browser: Klik pada elemen
  Browser->>Tracker: Dispatch event (coords, viewport, path, tenant)
  Note right of Tracker: Validasi payload & sampling bila diperlukan
  Tracker->>API: POST payload {x,y,viewport,path,tenant}
  API->>Store: Persist event
  Store-->>API: Ack (201)
  API-->>Tracker: 201 Created
  Note over Admin,Store: Admin memuat overlay heatmap per path/windowMs
  Admin->>API: GET /api/analytics/heatmap?path=&windowMs=
  API->>Store: Query aggregated points
  Store-->>API: Points + intensities
  API-->>Admin: Render overlay

  Note over API: ensureTenantHeader, withRBAC(admin), withMetrics
